# =============================================================================
# Flamoral Dating Platform - Production Environment Configuration Template
# =============================================================================
# SECURITY CRITICAL: ALL sensitive values MUST be stored in Azure Key Vault
# This file is a comprehensive template showing the structure for all services
# Never commit actual production secrets to version control
#
# Usage:
#   1. Copy this file to .env.production
#   2. Replace all *** placeholders with actual values from Azure Key Vault
#   3. Use managed identity for automatic secret injection in Kubernetes
#   4. Validate with: ./scripts/validate-env.sh production
#
# Last Updated: 2025-12-11
# =============================================================================

